  "details": "Much like https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/gesture-lock-invoked-from-controller-action-permanently-activates-soft-gesture-s\n\nSame ordeal: use advanced preset, try binding some gesture to a trigger, then activate a different gesture using the trackpad only, release the gesture, and then activate the trigger to see that the gesture did not override the previously selected one. So far it should behave as expected.\n\nNow open the dashboard, close it, and check it again. What you should be seeing is soft gesture selection being activated at all times on the controller you've opened the dashboard with. Selecting any gesture from the trackpad will now override the previously chosen gesture. This persists until the controller in question is restarted.",
